  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents.PostgreSql.EntityFrameworkCore 0.1.0-alpha.3\n\n      Added\n      - Forward-only built-in PostgreSQL migrations with strict history and checksums.\n      - Session-scoped advisory locking, timeout, cancellation, and concurrency safety.\n      - Existing alpha outbox baselining without recreating the table.\n      - Structured migration logging and public MigrateTinyEventsAsync support.\n\n      Ownership\n      - Migration execution borrows the scoped DbContext connection and preserves its ownership and open state.\n      - Publishing still commits business data and outbox messages through caller-owned SaveChangesAsync.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Early alpha / active development.\n      - Upgrade every TinyEvents package in the application to alpha.3 together.",
